flowchart TB
    accTitle: Melder self-documentation build and reading descent
    accDescr: Authored architecture, component, and graph document-index pairs are verified at build time and emitted as an eager manifest, deferred section tables, lazy Python text payloads, and graph adjacency. Runtime publishes four package-root query views. A reader descends from architecture orientation through component slices and graph traversal to source code. The handmade engineering drawings remain a separate static documentation lane.

    subgraph build["Build-time capture · repository to package"]
        direction LR
        maps["Authored maps + indexes<br/>architecture · components · graph"]
        runner["Asset runner<br/>discovers _builder.py"]
        verify["Verification gate<br/>system-document builder<br/>line count + SHA-256"]
        manifest["Generated Python assets<br/>manifest · section tables<br/>payloads · graph adjacency"]
        loader["system_documents.py<br/>construct query views"]
        roots["Package-root surfaces<br/>__architecture__ · __components__<br/>__graph_network__ · __graph_details__"]

        maps --> runner --> verify --> manifest --> loader --> roots
    end

    subgraph lazy["Runtime cost is deferred"]
        direction LR
        eager["Import: manifest + four lightweight views"]
        index["First index/get:<br/>load section table"]
        payload["First text read:<br/>load one document payload"]
        adjacency["First graph walk:<br/>load adjacency"]
        eager --> index
        index --> payload
        index --> adjacency
    end

    subgraph read["Agent / contributor reading descent"]
        direction LR
        architecture["1 · Architecture<br/>read broad orientation"]
        components["2 · Components<br/>index then focused get"]
        network["3 · Graph network<br/>walk nodes + edges"]
        details["4 · Graph details<br/>open source-path section"]
        code["5 · Source code<br/>behavioral authority"]
        architecture --> components --> network --> details --> code
    end

    drawings["Engineering drawings<br/>manual SVG + Mermaid companions<br/>not ingested or regenerated"]

    roots --> eager
    roots --> architecture
    maps -.-> drawings
    drawings -.->|"visual orientation"| architecture

    classDef authored fill:#fff3d6,stroke:#9a6700,color:#3d2900,stroke-width:2px
    classDef build fill:#e8f0ff,stroke:#315a99,color:#10213d,stroke-width:2px
    classDef lazy fill:#e7f7fa,stroke:#287a88,color:#123b43,stroke-width:2px
    classDef read fill:#eaf7ef,stroke:#3f7a56,color:#153824,stroke-width:2px
    classDef static fill:#fff0e8,stroke:#a4552a,color:#4a2411,stroke-width:2px
    class maps authored
    class runner,verify,manifest,loader,roots build
    class eager,index,payload,adjacency lazy
    class architecture,components,network,details,code read
    class drawings static
